{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-48-parkside","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"48-parkside-tabeer-development-arjan","about":"48 Parkside is a 10-storey luxury apartment complex by luxury developer Tabeer, located in the heart of Arjan, Dubai.The flats in the complex feature a contemporary design and include studios and 1-3 bedroom flats. All residences feature modern finishes, spacious layouts, and balconies and terraces with gorgeous views of the neighbourhood.Residents will enjoy an impressive array of luxury amenities such as a temperature-controlled swimming pool, spa, sauna, fitness centre, pilates and yoga room, cinema, barbecue area, café, restaurant, playground, kids club and nursery, children's pool, basketball court, sports court, tennis court, as well as landscaped green areas, 24-hour security and concierge service.The complex is also connected to the rest of the city, providing easy access to shopping centres, schools, hospitals and other attractions.From the complex, it takes approximately 22 minutes to Dubai Mall, 16 minutes to Palm Jumeirah, 19 minutes to Burj Al Arab and 20 minutes to Walk JBR. Dubai International Airport (DXB) is approximately 28 minutes' drive away and Al Maktoum International Airport is approximately 28 minutes' drive away.A full package of luxury amenities, elegant interiors and a convenient location make the complex attractive to prospective residents.","price":955048,"title":"48 Parkside","bitrix":{"id":878,"pf_id":"are.2.13462","source":null,"project_id":"48 Parkside","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"48 Parkside","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Tabeer Development","project_location":"Arjan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/759/images/2024/01/19/340x252/Gfu54jTIRs2zmkuU26eUXW8XyPyfAMhgEl2w1Sln.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/759/images/2024/01/19/4